senses.gloss:
झ 2. झ, अस्, आ, अम्, asleep, sleeping; lost,
destroyed; (अस्), m. a peculiar sound; playing a tune,
beating time; a sound like the splashing of water or
the clashing of symbols, jingling, clanking, &c.;
wind accompanied by rain; a stray, a thing lost or
mislaid; a N. of a chief of the Daityas or demons;
an epithet of Bṛhaspati, the preceptor of the gods;
(आ), f. the descent of a cascade, a water-fall.
